text:
Most of the mechanics they shared from the development on instagram are gone at first it was supposed to be a sandbox casino game where you could mess around the casino and have fun with your friends (stealing each other's and npc's chips, hitting things with a bat for money, running and hiding from casino guards after causing mischief, doing different random stuff) none of that are in the release and now with this release is just a time limited mission quota focused another one of those quota extraction games feels like a copy paste of that genre. This is why game planning is soo important while making a game. If you want a party game that you and your friends will play once and drop you can get it otherwise I would stay clear from it as without a good update planning its most likely to be abandoned after 2-3 smallest of updates. Wish they didn't turn it 180 degrees to be a clone of other games and stayed original instead.

TL:DR;
It was supposed to be sandbox and fun had more and fun mechanics before release. All of them got removed and they changed it into a time limited quota fill game. More like "Stress out don't have fun and Fill your quota with your friends in 5 min" The Game.
